%% 10 Notification flow
flowchart LR
  inc[Incident] --> mode{mode allows external?<br/>not Air-gapped/Replay}
  mode -- no --> drop[local only]
  mode -- yes --> route[severity routing]
  route --> dedupe[dedupe: one message per incident, updates grouped]
  dedupe --> quiet{quiet hours?<br/>critical overrides}
  quiet --> san[sanitize: structured fields + validated text,<br/>escape per platform, no mentions]
  san --> rl[per-channel + global rate limit]
  rl --> send[send]
  send -- fail --> retry[exponential backoff]
  retry --> cb{circuit breaker open?}
  cb -- yes --> state[visible failure state in GUI]
  cb -- no --> send
  send --> log[(delivery log)]
